    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for suggestion!\r\n\r\nAt the moment I don't think adding this meets the \"features-maintenance\" trade-off. I agree that speeding up animation in case of a large number of lines is probably the best thing to do. If you don't mind, could you share how you tweak animation to fit your taste?\r\n\r\nI'll think about it.\r\n\r\nSome semi-random thoughts:\r\n- If anything, the option should be something like `minimal_indent` with minimal indent to draw (default to 0).\r\n- The only concern here might be performance, but I don't think it will matter here *that* much.",
